           </div>
           <h1 className="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tight uppercase italic">LRC Artisan Flow</h1>
           <p className="text-gray-500 font-medium text-sm mt-1">Orchestrating High-Precision Manufacturing</p>
